      "url": "https://www.antiochne.edu/",
      "summary": "The webpage for Antioch University-New England provides an overview of the university's academic offerings, campus details, and other resources available for prospective and current students. It includes information about degree programs, admissions, financial aid, and upcoming events. The institution emphasizes a progressive education model where theory meets practice, and encourages personal growth and innovation. Additionally, it highlights the importance of experiential education across disciplines for a meaningful career.",
