      "title": "Antioch University Strategic Plan",
      "url": "https://hub.antioch.edu/strategicplan",
      "summary": "Antioch University’s Strategic Plan for 2024-2030 builds on its history of innovation to construct a roadmap for achieving its mission of providing transformative education. The plan envisions becoming an academically integrated national university, with a broadened scope of programs and increased presence across campuses and markets. The strategic themes include enhancing teaching excellence, student achievement, scholarship and service, social engagement, and building inclusive communities.",
